WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:56.500
[Instrumental Intro]

00:00:57.517 --> 00:01:01.863
Transmission sent, but no reply

00:01:04.646 --> 00:01:10.000
Just the static falling from the sky

00:01:10.200 --> 00:01:14.200
I've got the dials turned up to ten

00:01:14.300 --> 00:01:20.415
Waiting for the world to start again

00:01:20.455 --> 00:01:23.800
It's just radio silence

00:01:23.900 --> 00:01:27.500
Nothing on the airwaves tonight

00:01:27.600 --> 00:01:30.200
Radio silence

00:01:30.300 --> 00:01:34.200
Waiting for a spark to ignite

00:01:34.300 --> 00:01:38.200
I'm calling out into the dark

00:01:38.300 --> 00:01:41.200
Just trying to make a mark

00:01:41.300 --> 00:01:45.038
In the radio silence

00:01:50.920 --> 00:01:56.500
The frequency is cold and dead

00:01:56.600 --> 00:02:02.500
Just the ringing echoing in my head

00:02:02.600 --> 00:02:06.500
We built this tower to the stars

00:02:06.600 --> 00:02:12.500
But nobody knows who we are

00:02:12.893 --> 00:02:16.200
It's just radio silence

00:02:16.300 --> 00:02:19.800
Nothing on the airwaves tonight

00:02:19.900 --> 00:02:22.800
Radio silence

00:02:22.900 --> 00:02:26.800
Waiting for a spark to ignite

00:02:26.900 --> 00:02:31.231
I'm calling out into the dark

00:02:31.832 --> 00:02:34.500
Just trying to make a mark

00:02:34.600 --> 00:02:37.454
In the radio silence

00:02:43.637 --> 00:02:46.800
Can anybody hear me?

00:02:46.900 --> 00:02:50.043
Can anybody see the light?

00:02:50.623 --> 00:02:54.907
I'm broadcasting on the edge of the night!

00:02:55.200 --> 00:03:23.000
[Guitar Solo]

00:03:23.541 --> 00:03:26.800
It's just radio silence

00:03:26.900 --> 00:03:30.200
Nothing on the airwaves tonight

00:03:30.300 --> 00:03:33.000
Radio silence

00:03:33.100 --> 00:03:37.000
Waiting for a spark to ignite

00:03:37.100 --> 00:03:41.200
I'm calling out into the dark

00:03:41.300 --> 00:03:44.200
Just trying to make a mark

00:03:44.300 --> 00:03:47.500
In the radio silence

00:03:47.600 --> 00:03:50.500
Just static...

00:03:51.338 --> 00:03:55.000
Just silence...

00:03:58.260 --> 00:04:02.000
Just silence...

00:04:02.500 --> 00:04:29.000
[Outro]
